msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzariak ez zuen garaiz erantzun."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server took too long to answer."
msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzariak denbora gehiegi behar izan zuen erantzuteko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer has no list of posts."
msgstr "Iturri-zerbitzariaren erantzunak ez du posta-zerrendarik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer holds something that is not a post id."
msgstr "Iturri-zerbitzariaren erantzunak post-id bat ez den zerbait dauka."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is not JSON."
msgstr "Iturri-zerbitzariaren erantzuna ez da JSON."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is not a JSON object."
msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzariaren erantzuna ez da JSON objektua."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is too large."
msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzariaren erantzuna handiegia da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's certificate could not be checked."
msgstr "Ezin izan da iturburu-zerbitzariaren ziurtagiria egiaztatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's cursor is not usable."
msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzariaren kurtsorea ez da erabilgarria."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's address sends it somewhere else too many times."
msgstr "Iturburuaren helbideak beste leku askotan bidaltzen du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's answer is too large."
msgstr "Iturrien erantzuna handiegia da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's certificate could not be checked."
msgstr "Ezin izan da iturria egiaztatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The file's size is missing."
msgstr "Fitxategiaren tamaina falta da."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are approved to forward to +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile hauek onartzen dira +%(guild)s(e)ra joateko."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are prohibited from participating in +%(guild)s guild chat."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile hauek +%(guild)s berriketara joatea debekatuta dago."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are prohibited from participating in +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile hauek +%(guild)s(e)n parte hartzea debekatuta dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild"
msgstr "Guild"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a category with that name."
msgstr "Gildak badu kategoria bat izen horrekin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a channel with that name."
msgstr "Gildak badu izen hori duen kanal bat."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a role with that name."
msgstr "Gildak badu jadanik izen hori."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild's own rules for what is written in its channels, on top of the site's word filter. Guildmasters are never held to them. A message that breaks one is refused with a short reason that never says which word."
msgstr "Guild-en arauak bere kanaletan idatzitakoarentzat, guneko hitz-iragazkiaren gainean. Guild moderatzaileek ez diete inoiz eusten. Bat hausten duen mezua ukatu egiten da, inoiz ez baitu esaten zein hitz."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The host stays on stage."
msgstr "Ostalaria agertokian geratzen da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The independent social platform"
msgstr "Plataforma sozial independentea"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The internet gremlins have led you to a dark, musty dead-end. There's nothing here."
msgstr "Interneteko gremlinek hil-amaiera ilunera eraman zaituzte. Hemen ez dago ezer."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The key that opens your messages in a new app. It is locked with your password and opened here, in this browser: %(site)s never sees it. Anyone with it and your account can read your chats, so never share it."
msgstr "Zure mezuak aplikazio berri batean irekitzen dituen gakoa. Zure pasahitzarekin blokeatuta dago eta hemen irekitzen da, arakatzaile honetan: %(site)sk ez du inoiz ikusten. Edonork irakurri ahal izango ditu zure berriketak, beraz, inoiz ez partekatu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link `%(link)s` is not allowed. Reason: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Ez da onartzen `%(link)s` esteka. Arrazoia: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link `%(link)s` is not allowed. Reason: %(reason)s."
msgstr "Ez da onartzen `%(link)s` esteka. Arrazoia: %(reason)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The link can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Esteka gehienez karaktere bat izan daiteke."
msgstr[1] "Estekak gehienez %(num)s karaktere izan ditzake."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Estekak ezin du erabiltzaile-izenik edo pasahitzik eduki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Estekak ezin du zuriunerik eduki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Esteka https:// edo http://.-rekin hasi behar da"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Estekak helbide osoa behar du, adibidez, example.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list is open to members so that anyone can see what the filter hides and why. Nothing on it is removed from the site: each member's own filter decides what they see."
msgstr "Zerrenda irekita dago, edonork ikus dezan iragazkia zer ezkutatzen den eta zergatik. Ez da ezer kentzen gunetik: bakoitzak bere iragazkia erabakitzen du zer ikusten duen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list isn't shown on the Child filter"
msgstr "Zerrenda ez da Child iragazkian erakusten"

#, python-format
msgid "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coin every 30 days."
msgid_plural "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coins every 30 days."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The most voted posts of the last seven days."
msgstr "Azken zazpi egunetako post bozkatuenak."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The name %(host)s could not be found."
msgstr "Ezin izan da %(host)s izena aurkitu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The newest of what they have done. Only the names of who they chat with are shown, never what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted."
msgstr "Egin duten berriena. Hizketan ari direnen izenak bakarrik erakusten dira, inoiz ez berriketak dioena: berriketak amaieraraino enkriptatuta daude."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of an anonymous author"
msgstr "Egile anonimo baten kopurua"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of items you confirmed doesn't match what was chosen. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Berretsi duzun elementu kopurua ez dator bat aukeratutakoarekin. Ez da ezer aldatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The numbers are always shown on your profile. This decides who can open each list and see the accounts on it. An account is only listed where its own setting allows it too."
msgstr "Zenbakiak beti zure profilean erakusten dira. Horrek erabakitzen du nork ireki eta nork ikus ditzakeen kontuak. Kontu bat bere ezarpenek ere onartzen duten tokian bakarrik dago zerrendatuta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The open-source platform for independent internet communities"
msgstr "Interneteko komunitate independenteentzako kode irekiko plataforma"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The original content is not retained anywhere, including in this history."
msgstr "Jatorrizko edukia ez da inon gordetzen, baita historia honetan ere."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The other authors of a shared draft removed you as an author. What you wrote stays credited to you."
msgstr "Zirriborro partekatu baten beste egileek autore gisa kendu zintuzten. Zuk idatzi zenuena zuri dagokizu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner deletes a channel instead of leaving it."
msgstr "Jabeak kanal bat ezabatzen du utzi ordez."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner's role can't be changed."
msgstr "Ezin da jabearen papera aldatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The page's current text isn't shown here; what you save replaces it."
msgstr "Orriaren uneko testua ez da hemen erakusten; gordetzen duzunak ordeztu egiten du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture could not be stored. Try again later."
msgstr "Ezin izan da irudia gorde. Saiatu berriro geroago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture goes to your own linked storage, not to this site. You can add a few words under it."
msgstr "Irudia zure biltegira doa, ez gune honetara. Hitz batzuk gehi ditzakezu azpian."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture you chose"
msgstr "Aukeratu duzun argazkia"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post appears on the profile of whoever publishes it first. Optionally forward it into guilds for community discussion: each guild gets its own independent copy with its own votes and comments. Guilds are forwarded to when the draft is first published."
msgstr "Postua lehenengo argitaratzen duenaren profilan agertzen da. Aukeran, komunitate-eztabaidarako guildetara bidaltzen du: langile bakoitzak bere kopia independentea lortzen du bere boto eta iruzkinekin. Guilds aurrera doa zirriborroa lehen aldiz argitaratzen denean."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post carries your name and is listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your name."
msgstr "Mezuak zure izena darama eta zure profilean dago zerrendatuta. Botoak, iruzkinak eta birbidalketak autorearekin partekatzen dira, editatu eta ezabatzen duena. Edozein unetan jaitsi zaitezke: posta zure izenik gabe geratuko da."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post is not listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your credit."
msgstr "Posta ez dago zure profilean zerrendatuta. Botoak, iruzkinak eta birbidalketak autorearekin partekatzen dira, editatu eta ezabatzen duena. Edozein unetan utz dezakezu kargua: zure krediturik gabe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post refused the change."
msgstr "Postuak aldaketa ukatu zuen."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post stays where it is, with your name taken off it, and leaves your profile. Its Rep leaves you too. Everyone who saw it with your name still knows it was you."
msgstr "Postua dagoen lekuan geratuko da, zure izena kendu eta zure profila utziko du. Ospeak ere uzten zaitu. Zure izenarekin ikusi zuten guztiek dakite zu zinela."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author"
msgstr "Postaren egilea"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author deleted it, so it is shown as Anonymous: no name and no link. The comments under it stay as they were; one its author deleted is shown as Anonymous too."
msgstr "Postaren egileak ezabatu egin du, eta Anonimo gisa erakusten da: izenik eta estekarik ez. Azpiko iruzkinak geratu egiten dira, ezabatutako autore bat anonimo gisa ere erakusten da."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The promo code `%(code)s` is not currently valid. Please begin a new transaction."
msgstr "Promo kodea `%(code)s` Une honetan ez da baliozkoa. Hasi transakzio berri bat."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The proposal for @%(name)s has been withdrawn."
msgstr "@%(name)s(r)en proposamena erretiratu egin da."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was deleted."
msgstr "%(role)s funtzioa ezabatu egin da."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was made."
msgstr "%(role)s funtzioa egin zen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was saved."
msgstr "%(role)s funtzioa gorde da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The royal bank has told us that you owe them some coin. You'll need to pay off your debts before you can continue."
msgstr "Bankuak esan digu txanpon bat zor diezula. Zure zorrak ordaindu beharko dituzu jarraitu aurretik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules"
msgstr "Arauak"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules below"
msgstr "Beheko arauak"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The rules can be at most %(count)s character."
msgid_plural "The rules can be at most %(count)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Arauak gehienez %(count)s karakterekoak izan daitezke."
msgstr[1] "Arauak gehienez %(count)s karaktere izan daitezke."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules can't contain control or invisible characters."
msgstr "Arauek ezin dituzte kontrolatu edo ikusizko karaktereak eduki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The screenshot you are sending"
msgstr "Bidaltzen ari zaren pantaila-argazkia"

#. %(status)s is an HTTP status code
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answered %(status)s."
msgstr "Zerbitzariak %(status)s erantzun zuen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answers with the posts to show and their order; %(site)s still hides anything a viewer may not see, and tells the server nothing about who is looking. Everyone is told that an outside server ranks this curation."
msgstr "Zerbitzariak mezuekin eta haien ordenarekin erantzuten du; %(site)sk ikusten ez duen zerbait ezkutatzen du, eta zerbitzariari ez dio ezer esaten begiratzen duenari buruz. Mundu guztiak esaten du kanpoko zerbitzari batek elikatzen duela."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server named %(num)s post; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgid_plural "The server named %(num)s posts; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgstr[0] "Zerbitzaria %(num)s postakoa da, eta %(seen)s ikus dezakezu."
msgstr[1] "%(num)s mezu dituen zerbitzaria, %(seen)s ikus dezakezu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The server thinks you're asking something silly. It might take you more seriously if you take off the jester outfit."
msgstr "Zerbitzariak uste du txorakeria bat eskatzen ari zarela. Serioago hartu beharko zenuke bufoi-jantzia kentzen baduzu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site refused the bot's session."
msgstr "Guneak uko egin zion bot-aren saioari."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins have it already."
msgstr "Gunearen administratzaileek badute jadanik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site's admins marked this guild sensitive, so only an admin can change this."
msgstr "Guneko administratzaileek sentikortasun hau markatu zuten, beraz, kudeatzaile batek bakarrik alda dezake hau."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins will read it. They are never told who reported."
msgstr "Guneko administratzaileek irakurriko dute. Inoiz ez da jakiten nork jakinarazi duen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The stage is full (%(num)s person)."
msgid_plural "The stage is full (%(num)s people)."
msgstr[0] "Agertokia beteta dago (%(num)s pertsona)."
msgstr[1] "Agertokia beteta dago (%(num)s pertsona)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The storage service is not answering right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Biltegi-zerbitzuak ez du erantzuten. Saiatu berriro une batean."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The summary can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The summary can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Laburpena gehienez karaktere bat izan daiteke."
msgstr[1] "Laburpena gehienez %(num)s karaktere izan daiteke."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The summary can be changed while the Space is live."
msgstr "Laburpena alda daiteke espazioa bizi den bitartean."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text isn't shown: this was removed by the site's administrators."
msgstr "Testua ez da erakusten: guneko administratzaileek kendu zuten."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text of this version was hidden by a site administrator."
msgstr "Bertsio honen testua gune-administratzaile batek ezkutatu zuen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time before links must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Esteken aurreko denbora egun kopuru oso bat izango da, 0tik %(max)sra."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time in the guild must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Guildeko denbora egun osokoa izango da, 0tik %(max)sra."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The title can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The title can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Tituluak gehienez karaktere bat izan dezake."
msgstr[1] "Tituluak gehienez %(num)s karaktere izan ditzake."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The two revisions have the same text."
msgstr "Bi berrikuspenek testu bera dute."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your Google Drive. Try again."
msgstr "Igotzea ez da zure Google Drive-ra iritsi. Saiatu berriro."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your OneDrive. Try again."
msgstr "Igotzea ez da zure OneDrive-ra iritsi. Saiatu berriro."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive. Try again."
msgstr "Igoera ez zen iritsi. Saiatu berriro."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The username @%(name)s has been pre-emptively reserved for: %(who)s"
msgstr "@%(name)s erabiltzaile-izena aurrez gorde da: %(who)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The usual order - everything from the guilds and accounts you add"
msgstr "Ohiko ordena - gehitzen dituzun gremio eta kontu guztiak"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading to Dailymotion. Add it again."
msgstr "Bideoa ez zen Dailymotion(e)ra igotzen bukatu. Gehitu berriro."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading. Add it again."
msgstr "Bideoa ez zen igo. Gehitu berriro."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The website can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The website can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Webgunea gutxienez karaktere bat izan daiteke."
msgstr[1] "Webguneak gehienez %(num)s karaktere izan ditzake."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Webguneak ezin du erabiltzaile-izenik edo pasahitzik eduki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Webguneak ezin du zuriunerik eduki."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Webgunea https:// edo http://.-rekin hasi behar da"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Webguneak helbide osoa behar du, adibidez, example.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The whole site <span class=\"text-muted\">(needs an age limit of a month or less)</span>"
msgstr "Gune osoa <span class=\"text-muted\">(Hileko edo gutxiagoko adin-muga behar da)</span>"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki is off: only guildmasters see it."
msgstr "Wikia itzalita dago: moderatzaileek bakarrik ikusten dute."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki's first page can be emptied but not deleted."
msgstr "Wikiaren lehen orrialdea hustu daiteke, baina ez ezabatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The word filter has no words at the moment."
msgstr "Iragazki hitzak ez du hitzik une honetan."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The words for other languages are adapted from %(source)s (%(licence)s): words that are also ordinary, innocent words were left out."
msgstr "Beste hizkuntzetarako hitzak %(source)s(%(licence)s)-tik datoz: hitz arrunt eta errugabeak ere ezabatu dira."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The working copy as it is now. Only its authors can see this until it's published."
msgstr "Lan kopia orain bezala. Egileek bakarrik ikus dezakete hau argitaratu arte."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Theater"
msgstr "Antzerkia"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their commenting history will show here."
msgstr "Haien historia azalduko da hemen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their forwarding activity will show here."
msgstr "Beren jarduera aurkeztuko da hemen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posting history will show here."
msgstr "Postaren historia hemen agertuko da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posts and comments are left out of your feeds and threads and they cannot notify you. They are not told, and they can still follow you, comment on your posts and message you. Their anonymous posts and comments are not hidden, as hiding only those would tell you who wrote them. Mute someone from the menu on any of their posts or comments, or from their profile."
msgstr "Haien mezuak eta iruzkinak jario eta harietatik kanpo geratzen dira eta ezin dizute jakinarazi. Ez dira kontatzen, eta oraindik ere jarraitzen dizute, zure mezu eta mezuei buruz. Beren mezu eta iruzkin anonimoak ez dira ezkutatuko, nork idatzi zituen esango luketen bezala. Menuko norbait bere mezu edo iruzkinen batean edo bere profilaren batean mututu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no approved users"
msgstr "Ez dago onartutako erabiltzailerik"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no exiled users"
msgstr "Ez dago erbesteratutako erabiltzailerik"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmaster invitations."
msgstr "Ez dago moderatzailearen gonbidapenik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmasters."
msgstr "Ez dago moderatzaile koipetsurik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no posts here."
msgstr "Hemen ez dago postarik."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "There is no account named @%(name)s."
msgstr "Ez dago @%(name)s izeneko konturik."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There is nothing here to appeal."
msgstr "Hemen ez dago ezer apelatzeko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There is nothing to save yet."
msgstr "Oraindik ez dago ezer salbatzeko."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There is nothing waiting for this ban."
msgstr "Ez dago ezer debeku honen zain."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There was a problem. Please try again."
msgstr "Arazo bat zegoen. Saiatu berriro."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no names in that file."
msgstr "Ez zegoen izenik fitxategi horretan."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no survivors."
msgstr "Ez zen bizirik irten."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's a shortage of perfect request entities in this world. Would be a pity to damage yours."
msgstr "Mundu honetan eskaera-erakunde ezin hobeak falta dira. Pena litzateke zurea kaltetzea."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's already an open proposal like this one."
msgstr "Horrelako proposamen irekia dago jadanik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no account with that name."
msgstr "Ez dago konturik izen horrekin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no invitation to speak."
msgstr "Ez dago hitz egiteko gonbidapenik."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There's no recovery code to keep yet."
msgstr "Oraindik ez dago berreskuratzeko koderik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing here right now."
msgstr "Hemen ez dago ezer."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing left here but a giant smouldering crater."
msgstr "Hemen ez dago ezer krater ketsu erraldoi bat besterik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These are the users you are subscribed to."
msgstr "Hauek dira harpidetutako erabiltzaileak."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These counts start from the day guild insights were switched on: before that the site did not record when people left a guild or how often its page was opened."
msgstr "Kontakizun hauek hasiera-hasieratik hasi ziren informazio huts bat piztu zen egunetik: lehenago, guneak ez zuen grabatu jendeak langa bat utzi zuenean edo orrialdea zenbat aldiz ireki zen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These filters are saved as your default"
msgstr "Iragazkiak lehenetsi gisa gordetzen dira"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These topics"
msgstr "Gai hauek"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These users have been invited to moderate +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile hauek +%(guild)s moderatura gonbidatu dituzte."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They already have this role."
msgstr "Dagoeneko badute zeregin hori."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are 18 or over, so they can make their own account."
msgstr "18 urte edo gehiago dituzte, beraz, beren kontua egin dezakete."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are already in this circle."
msgstr "Dagoeneko zirkulu honetan daude."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are not told. Anyone you block leaves your circles."
msgstr "Ez dira esaten. Blokeatzen duzun edonork zirkuluak uzten dizkizu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They are signed out everywhere, chat apps included. If they use chat, they may need their recovery code, or a browser where they've used chat, to read their old messages."
msgstr "Leku guztietan deskonektatuta daude, berriketa-aplikazioak barne. Berriketa erabiltzen badute, berreskurapen-kodea beharko dute, edo berriketan erabili duten arakatzailea, mezu zaharrak irakurtzeko."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "They aren't in %(circle)s."
msgstr "Ez daude %(circle)s(e)n."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't in this group."
msgstr "Ez daude talde honetan."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't muted here."
msgstr "Hemen ez daude mutu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can buy and spend coins, tip, buy Premium and join or run paid circles."
msgstr "Txanponak erosi eta gastatu ditzakete, eskupekoa, Premium erosi eta ordaindutako zirkuluak batu edo exekutatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can host and join Spaces and run live threads. Voice calls in a Space also need Chat to be on."
msgstr "Espazioetan sartu eta zuzeneko hariak exekuta ditzakete. Ahots-deiak espazio batean ere egin behar dira berriketak."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can message people, join group chats and make calls. The site never shows you what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted. Whoever knows their password can still sign in and read them."
msgstr "Jendeari mezuak bidali, talde-berriketan sartu eta deiak egin ditzakete. Guneak ez dizu inoiz erakusten zer esaten duen: berriketak amaieraraino enkriptatuta daude. Pasahitza dakienak oraindik sinatu eta irakurri egin ditzake."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can see what you do on the site: your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported, and your recent sign-ins. The site never shows them what your chats say, because chats are end-to-end encrypted. But anyone who knows your password, a parent who chose it included, can sign in as you: change it in Security so that only you know it. They choose which of these are on for your account:"
msgstr "Gunean zer egiten duzun ikus dezakete: zure mezuak, iruzkinak, botoak, laster-markak, jarraian, guildak, zure kontua eta zure azken sinatzaileak. Guneak ez die inoiz erakusten zure berriketak zer esaten duten, berriketak amaieran enkriptatzen direlako. Baina zure pasahitza ezagutzen duen edonork, aukeratu duen guraso batek, sinatu ahal izango du zuk bezala: aldatu Segurtasunean, zuk bakarrik jakin dezazun. Horietako zein aukeratuko dute zure kontuan:"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They can start a guild. They still can't post or comment: a child account only reads."
msgstr "Guild bat has dezakete. Oraindik ezin dute idatzi edo iruzkinik egin: ume-kontu batek irakurtzen du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can't comment on your posts or comments, chat with you or notify you by mentioning you. They are not told, but they may work it out if they try to comment on something of yours."
msgstr "Ezin dute iruzkinik egin zure mezu edo iruzkinei buruz, zurekin berriketan edo zutaz hitz egin. Ez dira esaten, baina agian zure zerbaiti buruz hitz egiten saiatzen badira, jakingo dute."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They don't have this role."
msgstr "Ez dute zeregin hori."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They go straight to your coin balance."
msgstr "Zure txanpon-balantzetara doaz zuzenean."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They haven't asked for that."
msgstr "Ez dute hori eskatu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They leave the site. What they said stays in the Log as Anonymous, except for anything made in the last five minutes that nobody has commented on, which is erased. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Gunetik irteten dira. Esaten zutena Anonimo gisa geratzen da, azken bost minutuetan inork komentatu ez duen ezer izan ezik, ezabatua. Ezin da desegin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They need to be in the guild, and not exiled from it."
msgstr "Gerrikoan egon behar dute, eta ez dira bertatik erbesteratuak."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They need to join the channel first."
msgstr "Lehenbizi kanalean sartu behar dute."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They say they are 18 or over and asked you to release their account. If you do, it becomes their own and you can no longer see it."
msgstr "18 urte edo gehiago dituztela esaten dute eta beren kontua askatzeko eskatu dizute. Egiten baduzu, berea izango da eta ez duzu gehiago ikusiko."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They stay where they are, with your name taken off them. This can't be undone. Posts that need your name (for a Circle, or with tips) are listed afterwards as not changed."
msgstr "Dauden tokian gelditzen dira, zure izena kenduz. Ezin da desegin. Zure izena behar duten mezuak (Zirkulu baterako edo aholkuekin) ondoren zerrendatzen dira aldatu gabe."

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "They wrote: %(note)s"
msgstr "Idatzi zuten: %(note)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They're already a helper."
msgstr "Dagoeneko laguntzaileak dira."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They're already on stage."
msgstr "Agertokian daude dagoeneko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They've already been invited to speak."
msgstr "Hitz egitera gonbidatu dituzte."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Circle guild is by invitation only."
msgstr "Zirkulu hau gonbidapenez bakarrik dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Google account has no YouTube channel yet. Create one at youtube.com, then try again."
msgstr "Hau da hau: Google kontuak ez du YouTube Kanala oraindik. Sortu bat YouTube.com-en, eta saiatu berriro."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space"
msgstr "Espazio hau"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space can't take a replay now."
msgstr "Espazio honek ezin du berriro jokatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has already started."
msgstr "Espazio hau hasi da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended."
msgstr "Espazio hau amaitu da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended. Its board is still here to read."
msgstr "Espazio hau amaitu da. Bere taula oraindik irakurtzeko dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended. Its chat is still here to read."
msgstr "Espazio hau amaitu da. Haren berriketa oraindik hemen dago irakurtzeko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space hasn't started yet."
msgstr "Espazio hau ez da oraindik hasi."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This Space is full (%(num)s listener)."
msgid_plural "This Space is full (%(num)s listeners)."
msgstr[0] "Gune hau beteta dago (%(num)s entzule)."
msgstr[1] "Espazio hau beteta dago (%(num)s entzule)."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This Space is live until %(time)s."
msgstr "Espazio hau %(time)s arte bizi da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space is live."
msgstr "Espazio hau bizirik dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space is not recorded: when it ends, it is gone, with everything in it."
msgstr "Espazio hau ez da gordetzen: amaitzen denean, desagertu egiten da, bertan dagoen guztiarekin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space is recorded"
msgstr "Espazio hau grabatuta dago"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space is recorded: its board stays to read when it ends."
msgstr "Espazio hau grabatua dago: taulak irakurtzen jarraitzen du amaitzen duenean."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space is recorded: the host keeps a replay with the video."
msgstr "Gune hau grabatua dago: ostalariak bideoarekin jokatzen du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space is recorded: the host keeps a replay."
msgstr "Espazio hau grabatua dago: ostalariak berriro jokatzen du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space isn't available."
msgstr "Leku hau ez dago erabilgarri."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space isn't waiting to start."
msgstr "Espazio hau ez dago hasteko zain."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space keeps its sound only."
msgstr "Espazio honek bere soinua bakarrik gordetzen du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This access will expire in one hour, or earlier if you revoke it."
msgstr "Sarbide hau ordubete barru iraungiko da, edo lehenago, errebotatzen baduzu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This account can't use chat apps."
msgstr "Kontu honek ezin ditu berriketako aplikazioak erabili."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This account has been marked 18 or over since %(date)s."
msgstr "Kontu hau 18 edo gehiago markatu da %(date)s-tik."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This account has been permanently suspended from %(site)s."
msgstr "Kontu hau %(site)s(e)tik behin betiko eseki da."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This account has been temporarily suspended from %(site)s. Check back later."
msgstr "Kontu hau aldi baterako %(site)s-tik eseki da. Begiratu beranduago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This account is private"
msgstr "Kontu hau pribatua da"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This account is suspended."
msgstr "Kontu hau eten egin da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This account owes money, so it can't be deleted yet."
msgstr "Kontu honek dirua zor du, beraz ezin da ezabatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This account posts about sensitive topics"
msgstr "Kontu honek gai sentiberak jorratzen ditu"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This also signs out chat everywhere else, chat apps included, except the chat this browser has used since you signed in here."
msgstr "Honek beste leku guztietan ere deskonektatzen du berriketa-aplikazioak barne, arakatzaile honek hemen sinatu zenuenetik erabili duen berriketa izan ezik."

#. %(time)s is a length of time, such as "6 months"
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This author hasn't been active for %(time)s, so isn't counted."
msgstr "Egile hau ez da %(time)s(r)entzat aktiboa izan, beraz ez da kontuan hartzen."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This ban relies on:"
msgstr "Debeku hau oinarritzen da:"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This bot can't take tips right now."
msgstr "Bot honek ezin ditu aholkuak hartu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This bot has not been approved."
msgstr "Bot hau ez da onartu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This bot is not running."
msgstr "Bot hau ez da exekutatzen ari."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This bot's owner can't run it right now."
msgstr "-Botaren jabeak ezin du oraintxe bertan exekutatu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This browser was signed out. Sign in again to carry on."
msgstr "Arakatzailea deskonektatu egin da. Sinatu berriro jarraitzeko."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This browser's notifications couldn't be turned on. Try again."
msgstr "Arakatzailearen jakinarazpenak ezin dira piztu. Saiatu berriro."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This call is full (%(num)s person)."
msgid_plural "This call is full (%(num)s people)."
msgstr[0] "Dei hau beteta dago (%(num)s pertsona)."
msgstr[1] "Deialdia beteta dago (%(num)s pertsona)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This can't be translated right now."
msgstr "Ezin da orain itzuli."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This can't be undone. The site's admins can always see who wrote something, and if an admin bans or suspends the account for it, the Log may name the account for it."
msgstr "Ezin da desegin. Gunearen administratzaileek beti ikus dezakete nork idatzi zuen zerbait, eta administratzaile batek kontua debekatu edo esekitzen badu, Log-ek kontuari izena eman diezaioke."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel doesn't ask for its rules to be accepted."
msgstr "Kanal honek ez du bere arauak onartzeko eskatzen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel has no messages."
msgstr "Kanal honek ez du mezurik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel is end-to-end encrypted: it is read and written in Chat, where your messages are unlocked."
msgstr "Kanal hau enkriptatuta dago: Chat-en irakurri eta idazten da, non zure mezuak desblokeatzen diren."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel is end-to-end encrypted: the site can't read it, so it has no word filter, slow mode, pins, search or reports."
msgstr "Kanal hau amaierako enkriptatuta dago: guneak ezin du irakurri, beraz ez du hitz-iragazkirik, modu motelik, pinik, bilaketarik edo txostenik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel is full."
msgstr "Kanal hau beteta dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel is written from the chat itself."
msgstr "Kanal hau txatetik idatzita dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This channel isn't available."
msgstr "Kanal hau ez dago erabilgarri."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This circle isn't taking subscribers."
msgstr "Zirkulu honek ez ditu harpidedunak hartzen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This code can't be used. Get a new one on the computer, or sign in there with your password."
msgstr "Kode hau ezin da erabili. Jarri berri bat ordenagailuan edo sinatu pasahitzarekin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This code has run out."
msgstr "Kode hau amaitu da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This comment and the comments under it"
msgstr "Iruzkin hau eta azpiko iruzkinak"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This comment breaks %(site)s policy"
msgstr "Iruzkin honek %(site)s politika hausten du"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This comment can't be forwarded."
msgstr "Iruzkin hau ezin da birbidali."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This comment can't be reposted."
msgstr "Iruzkin hau ezin da berriro argitaratu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This comment is on a copy forwarded to a guild - ask that guild's guildmasters to remove it instead."
msgstr "Iruzkin hau guild bati bidalitako kopia batean dago - eskatu guildaren moderatzaileei kentzeko."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This comment section is a ghost town. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Sign in</a>"
msgstr "Iruzkin hau herri fantasma bat da. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Hasi saioa</a>"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This comment section is a ghost town. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Sign in</a> to comment!"
msgstr "Iruzkin hau herri fantasma bat da. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Hasi saioa</a> komentatzeko!"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This comment section is a ghost town. Be the first to comment!"
msgstr "Iruzkin hau herri fantasma bat da. Izan zaitez lehena hitz egiten!"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This comment section is a ghost town..."
msgstr "Iruzkin hau herri fantasma bat da..."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This content has already been posted"
msgstr "Eduki hau dagoeneko argitaratu da"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This copy is no longer kept."
msgstr "Kopia hau ez dago jadanik gordeta."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This couldn't be changed right now."
msgstr "Orain ezin da hau aldatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This creates a new, independent post in that guild with its own votes and comments. The title is generated from the comment's text. A link back to the original comment will be shown on the new post."
msgstr "Honek postu berri eta independente bat sortzen du bere boto eta iruzkinekin. Titulua iruzkinaren testutik sortzen da. Jatorrizko iruzkinerako esteka bat erakutsiko da mezu berrian."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This creates an independent copy of the post with its own votes and comments in that guild. You can forward to any guild that accepts forwards from you."
msgstr "Honek postaren kopia independentea sortzen du bere boto eta iruzkinekin. Aurrera egin ahal izango duzu zuregandik aurrera onartzen duen edozein florinera."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This curation's feed server has been asked too often. Try again in a minute."
msgstr "Janari-zerbitzari zaindu hau maizegi eskatu da. Saiatu berriro minutu batean."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This curation's feed server has not been answering."
msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzari zaindu honek ez du erantzun."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This curation's feed server has not been answering. Showing its last answer."
msgstr "Elikatze-zerbitzari zaindu honek ez du erantzun. Azken erantzuna erakusten."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This curation's guilds and accounts"
msgstr "Iturri eta kontu zaindu hau"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This curation's rules took too long to run. Its owner can make them narrower."
msgstr "Elikadura zainduaren arauek denbora gehiegi behar izan zuten exekutatzeko. Jabeak estutu egiten ditu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This decision can't be appealed."
msgstr "Erabaki hau ezin da apelatu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This decision has already been lifted."
msgstr "Erabaki hori dagoeneko kendu da."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This decision is about you. If you think it was wrong, you can appeal it."
msgstr "Erabaki hau zure esku dago. Oker zegoela uste baduzu, apela dezakezu."

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "This decision is in the Log, and you can appeal it: [See it in the Log](%(log)s) · [Appeal this decision](%(appeal)s)"
msgstr "Erabaki hau Log-ean dago, eta apela dezakezu: [Ikusi egunkarian](%(log)s) · [erabaki hau aplikatu](%(appeal)s)"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This deletes their account and everything on it. It can't be undone. You can download their data first."
msgstr "Honek bere kontua eta guzti ezabatzen ditu. Ezin da desegin. Datuak deskargatu ahal izango dituzu lehenik."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This device will be signed out shortly."
msgstr "Gailu hau berehala deskonektatuko da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This draft hasn't been published."
msgstr "Zirriborroa ez da argitaratu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This event is over."
msgstr "Ekitaldia amaitu da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This event was cancelled."
msgstr "Gertaera hau bertan behera utzi zen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This exact phrase"
msgstr "Esaldi zehatz hau"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This guild discusses sensitive topics"
msgstr "Gild honek gai sentikorrak eztabaidatzen ditu"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This guild discusses sensitive topics (every post here will be blurred by default)."
msgstr "Gild honek gai sentiberak eztabaidatzen ditu (mezu bakoitza lehenespenez lausotuko da)."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This guild is already banned."
msgstr "Guild hau debekatuta dago dagoeneko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This guild is banned."
msgstr "Guild hau debekatuta dago."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This guild is private. Content posted prior to the guild being set to private is visible to everyone."
msgstr "Ontzi hau pribatua da. Pribatuan ezarri aurretik argitaratutako edukia ikusgai dago guztiontzat."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This guild's channels are closed."
msgstr "Gild-en kanalak itxita daude."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This has a legal-level record, which can't be cited."
msgstr "Honek legezko maila du, eta ezin da aipatu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This has been deleted."
msgstr "Hau ezabatu egin da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This invitation was already answered."
msgstr "Gonbidapen hau jadanik erantzun da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This is a Space: its discussion is in the Space."
msgstr "Hau espazio bat da: bere eztabaida espazioan dago."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This is a Space: its discussion is in the Space. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Open the Space</a>"
msgstr "Hau espazio bat da: bere eztabaida espazioan dago. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Ireki espazioa</a>"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This is a Space: its host and co-hosts post its updates from the Space."
msgstr "Hau espazio bat da: bere ostalariek eta ko-ostalariek Espaziotik bidaltzen dituzte bere eguneraketak."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This is a log of moderator actions performed in +%(guild)s. The ones everyone may read are also in the site-wide <a href=\"%(url)s\">Log</a>. What members delete themselves is not published."
msgstr "Hau moderatzailearen ekintzen egunkaria da, +-n landua.%(guild)sEdonork irakurri ditzakeenak ere gune osoan daude. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Logikoa</a>Ez da argitaratzen ezabatzen diren kideak."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This is already anonymous."
msgstr "Hau dagoeneko anonimoa da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This is already in your language."
msgstr "Hau zure hizkuntzan dago jadanik."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This is for chat on this site. A chat app you use outside it follows its own setting."
msgstr "Hau gune honetako berriketarako da. Kanpoan erabiltzen duzun berriketa-aplikazioak bere ezarpena jarraitzen du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This is for the members of a Circle guild."
msgstr "Zirkulu bateko kideentzat da."

#. %(name)s is the username of the person who made the post
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This is for the people in one of <a href=\"%(url)s\">@%(name)s</a>'s circles."
msgstr "Hau pertsona batentzat da <a href=\"%(url)s\">@%(name)s</a>Zirkuluak."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This is in a private place, and a private item can't be cited in the public Log."
msgstr "Hau leku pribatu batean dago, eta ezin da egunkari publikoan aipatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This is the guild's custom CSS file."
msgstr "Hau CSS fitxategi pertsonalizatua da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This is too much like what was posted automatically today."
msgstr "Gaur egun automatikoki argitaratu denaren antzekoa da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This isn't available while your account is age-restricted. You can confirm your age in Settings > Content."
msgstr "Hau ez dago erabilgarri zure kontua adinez mugatuta dagoen bitartean. Zure adina baieztatu dezakezu Ezarpenak > Edukia."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This isn't one of the account's own posts or comments."
msgstr "Hau ez da kontuko mezu edo iruzkinetako bat."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This isn't shown at your current word filter level. You can review your word filter in your content settings."
msgstr "Hau ez da zure uneko hitzaren iragazki-mailan erakusten. Zure hitz-iragazkia berrikusi dezakezu edukiaren ezarpenetan."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This isn't shown where you are until your age has been confirmed. Sign in to do that in your content settings."
msgstr "Hau ez da erakusten non zauden zure adina baieztatu arte. Sinatu hori zure edukiaren ezarpenetan."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This isn't shown while your account is age-restricted."
msgstr "Hau ez da erakusten zure kontua adinez mugatuta dagoen bitartean."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "This isn't yours to change, or it is already gone."
msgstr "Hau ez da zurea, edo jadanik ez da aldatu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This live thread ended a moment ago. It can go live again in %(num)s min."
msgid_plural "This live thread ended a moment ago. It can go live again in %(num)s min."
msgstr[0] "Orain dela une bat amaitu zen. Berriro bizi daiteke minutu batean."
msgstr[1] "Orain dela une bat amaitu zen. %(num)s minututan bizi daiteke berriro."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This live thread has ended"
msgstr "Hari bizi hau amaitu da"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This may be misleading or needs context (request a community note)"
msgstr "Hau engainagarria izan daiteke edo testuingurua behar du (komunitateko ohar bat eskatu)"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This month"
msgstr "Hilabete honetan"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This needs a verified email address."
msgstr "Egiaztatutako helbide elektronikoa behar du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page is empty."
msgstr "Orri hau hutsik dago."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This page is generated by the %(site)s application introspecting its own routing functions. Nifty."
msgstr "Orrialde hau %(site)s aplikazioak sortzen du, bere funtzioen introspekzioan. Nifty."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page lists offensive words"
msgstr "Orri honek hitz iraingarriak zerrendatzen ditu"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page may not be embedded in other webpages."
msgstr "Orri hau ezin da beste web-orrietan kapsulatu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page was opened from a link, not by your camera."
