#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your parent or guardian set a new password for your account and you were signed out. Sign in with the new password, then change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it."
msgstr "Zure guraso edo tutoreak pasahitz berria ezarri du zure konturako eta deskonektatu egin zara. Sinatu pasahitz berriarekin, eta aldatu [Settings > Security](/settings/security) eta zuk bakarrik jakin dezazun."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian stopped managing your account. It keeps the child lock until you confirm your age in Settings > Content. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Zure gurasoak edo tutoreak ez du zure kontua kudeatzen. Umea blokeatu egiten da Ezarpenak > adina baieztatu arte. Edukia. Zure pasahitza aukeratu dute: aldatu [Settings > Security](/settings/security) edo zure izenean sinatu dezakete."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian's account was suspended, so yours is suspended until theirs is back."
msgstr "Zure guraso edo tutorearen kontua eten egin da, eta zurea bertan behera utzi dute, harik eta zurea itzuli arte."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password"
msgstr "Zure pasahitza"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your password has been changed. Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Pasahitza aldatu egin da. Beste gailuak deskonektatu egin dira."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password meets the requirements."
msgstr "Pasahitzak baldintzak betetzen ditu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your payouts"
msgstr "Zure ordainketak"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone approved this. Only continue if this is your account."
msgstr "Telefonoak onartu du. Jarraitu hau zure kontua bada."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone said no, so nobody was signed in."
msgstr "Telefonoak ezetz esan zuen, eta ez zen inor sartu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post is listed on your profile either way. Choose My profile to have its comments there too, and add guilds to post it straight into them: each guild gets its own copy with its own votes and comments."
msgstr "Zure posta zure profilean dago. Aukeratu Nire profila ere han iruzkinak egiteko, eta guildak gehitzeko, zuzenean bidaltzeko: lan bakoitzak bere kopia lortzen du bere boto eta iruzkinekin."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posting history will show here."
msgstr "Zure bidalketaren historia hemen agertuko da."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts are kept out of All."
msgstr "Zure mezuak ez dira denak betetzen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts can appear in All."
msgstr "Zure mezuak All-en ager daitezke."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts from the last 28 days, with what each got (a post and its guild forwards added up). Only you can see this; these are counts, never names."
msgstr "Azken 28 egunetako zure bidalketak, bakoitzak zer zeukan (posta bat eta bere eskularruak gehitu ziren). Zuk bakarrik ikus dezakezu hau: zenbaketak dira, inoiz ez izenak."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts stay on your profile and in the feeds of people who follow you, but All leaves them out. Copies you forward to a guild follow that guild's own setting, and anonymous posts always appear in All, so nobody can tell which ones are yours."
msgstr "Zure postuak zure profilean eta jarraitzen dizuten jendearen iturrietan geratzen dira, baina denek uzten dituzte. Aurrerantz kopiatzen zaitu gremio baten atzetik, eta leku anonimoak beti agertzen dira All-en, inork ez dezan esan zein diren zureak."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Zure profila"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile details have been updated."
msgstr "Profilaren xehetasunak eguneratu dira."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your purchase was successful. A receipt will be emailed to you from Paypal."
msgstr "Zure erosketa arrakastatsua izan da. ordainagiria Paypal-etik bidaliko zaizu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your roles"
msgstr "Zure rolak"

