"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"\"%(title)s\" zure posta programatuta ezin izan da argitaratu: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Zure zirriborroetan gordetzen da, zuk konpondu eta berriro antolatu ahal izateko."

#. a notification about a post with no title. %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"Untitled\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Ezin izan da zure \"Titulu gabea\" argitaratu: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Zure zirriborroetan gordetzen da, zuk konpondu eta berriro antolatu ahal izateko."

